{"id":"631936","name":"绿豆红枣粽","author":"厨色","authorId":"12901915","desc":"","cover":"images/631936/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"糯米","amount":"500克"},{"name":"绿豆","amount":"120克"},{"name":"红枣","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"干粽叶","amount":"适量"},{"name":"棉线","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"绿豆和糯米清洗干净，放入清水低温浸泡6个小时。","img":"images/631936/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"干粽叶放入开水中煮几分钟，泡软。","img":"images/631936/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"食材准备好了。","img":"images/631936/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"取一片粽叶，在1/3处折成漏斗状。","img":"images/631936/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放入一层绿豆糯米。","img":"images/631936/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放入红枣。","img":"images/631936/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"再放入一层绿豆糯米。","img":"images/631936/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"再放入红枣。","img":"images/631936/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"将上面的粽叶翻下来，覆盖封口，顺势将多余的叶子折向两端，形成一个角。","img":"images/631936/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"系上棉线。","img":"images/631936/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"全部做好。","img":"images/631936/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"放入煮锅煮40分钟，焖1-2个小时食用。","img":"images/631936/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/631936/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}